         1. Executive Key Metric Cards -> Instant view of landed cost (87.28 SAR), market ceiling (86.00 SAR), and strategic gap ($1.00 USD) -> Dynamic JS -> Quick executive understanding.
         2. Cost Component Breakdown Chart -> Chart.js Stacked Bar -> Visualizing Ex-Works, Freight, and Customs across 3 Scenarios -> Proves how $1.00 factory discount drops cost below Saudi ceiling.
         3. Action vs Inaction ROI Chart -> Chart.js Grouped Bar -> Comparing $1/bag support investment ($150k/mo) vs $10/bag future market re-acquisition cost ($1.5M/mo) -> Psychological driver for immediate executive action.
