                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-navy-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium block">Recommended Selling Price</span>
                            <div id="simSellPrice" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">85.00 <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">SAR</span></div>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 block">Respects ±2.00 SAR Price Control</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-navy-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium block">Agent Net Viability Margin</span>
                            <div id="simAgentMargin" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400">+1.47 <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">SAR/Bag</span></div>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 block">Covers logistics & storage</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-navy-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
