                        <p class="text-red-700 mt-0.5">Saudi mills are capitalizing on our 60-day vacancy, supplying bakeries directly in Seiyun, Mukalla, and Ma'rib with aggressive credit terms.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                        <strong class="text-navy-900 block font-bold">2. Technical Bakery Lock-In:</strong>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Industrial bakeries adjust water absorption and dough formulations to Saudi flour. Re-engaging them later requires heavy cash incentives.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100">
                        <strong class="text-emerald-900 block font-bold">3. Salalah's Geographic Advantage:</strong>
