                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mt-1">🛡️ The Hybrid Risk-Sharing Model</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                        <strong class="text-navy-900 block font-bold">Pillar 1: Ex-Works Pickup from Salalah:</strong>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Zero inland transport burden for Salalah Mills. Bin Kalilah manages logistics directly from the factory gate.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
